; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; The bestiary's monsters (data/units/bestiary_*.duke), heard: their blows, their pain, their deaths, a cry when the
; big ones come into sight, and the feet of those that walk -- walking.<Template>.<surface>, see data/sounds/sfx.duke.
; Every clip is one the game already ships (CREDITS.md); nothing new was recorded.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

